    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0550" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg378"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 832.85/54</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-01T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 1, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 29 [1 p.m.] in regard to French contract for German ships in
                    Brazil.</p>
                <p>Cable as soon as you can whether it is intended to put on any shipping North
                    Atlantic trade and terms cabled in your message. Arrangement apparently applies
                    to commerce between France and Brazil only.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
